3. EMBEDDED FONT — TINOS (REDISTRIBUTED IN THIS REPOSITORY)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

`src/reports/fonts.ts` contains base64-encoded WOFF2 subsets (latin, latin-ext,
vietnamese) of the Tinos font, generated from the npm package
`@fontsource/tinos` 5.3.0 by `scripts/gen-print-fonts.mjs`. The printed forms
(Phiếu sơ tuyển Mẫu 2, Mẫu 2a, Mẫu 2k) embed the font so that Vietnamese
diacritics and the A4 layout render the same way on every phone.

  Tinos — Copyright The Tinos Project Authors
  (https://github.com/googlefonts/tinos), a metric-compatible serif designed by
  Steve Matteson, licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.
  The full licence text is included at `third_party/tinos/LICENSE`.

  Under the OFL the font may be bundled and redistributed with software, but it
  must keep this notice and the licence text, must not be sold by itself, and
  must not be redistributed under a Reserved Font Name. Regenerate the subsets
  with `node scripts/gen-print-fonts.mjs` rather than editing `fonts.ts` by hand.

